Type: Feature
Needs Documentation: yes

Adds support for Kustom's upsell feature, and allows showing upsell products in the thankyou page iframe that can be added to the order after the initial purchase. The recommended products can be the cross-sells, upsells or new Kustom upsells of the ordered products, or set with the `kco_wc_upsell_recommendations` filter. Simple products and single variations can be recommended.
